# Main menu -> てもち (party), deep: list, cursor, つよさをみる (stats page, moves page with each move's description),
# ならびかえ (move the 2nd Pokémon down two), then quit with レポートしてやめる (writes the cartridge save).
# Needs the Lab save: tools/screen_diff/jp_gen1_save.py <file> --lab, in $GB_SAV_GREEN_LAB.
@gb green lab
1200 START 300 A 400 shot:main_menu
RIGHT 40 A 150 shot:party_prompt A 300 shot:party_list
DOWN 30 shot:party_cursor2 UP 30
A 40 shot:party_submenu
A 150 shot:stats_page 60 shot:stats_page_idle
A 100 shot:moves_page
CD 40 shot:move_bottom CR 40 shot:move_right CL 40 shot:move_left
A 100 shot:party_list_back
DOWN 30 A 40 DOWN 30 shot:submenu_reorder A 50 shot:reorder_pick
DOWN 30 DOWN 30 shot:reorder_target A 80 shot:reordered
B 80 shot:report_dialog A 40 shot:report_saving 150 shot:main_menu_after
